cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "EWAT v5 — Early-Warning & Anomaly-Typing telemetry dataset (Train Ticket)"
abstract: >-
  Multi-modal telemetry (metrics, traces, logs) collected on a Kubernetes
  deployment of the Train Ticket microservice benchmark (41 services), with
  Chaos Mesh ground-truth fault injection across 27 scenarios (mono-cause,
  compositional, held-out chaos primitives, and real-bug reproductions). Each
  episode provides an aligned signal tensor S(t), a dynamic service graph G(t),
  a missingness mask, and per-timestep regime/intensity labels. Includes a
  novelty (held-out) test split. Designed to bridge the benchmark-vs-production
  gap in microservice root-cause and early-warning research.
authors:
